    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεπ-άω</span></b> ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέπω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cover,
				shelter</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέμων σκεπόωσι
			κῦμα</span> (
				Ep.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεπάουσι, σκεπῶσι</span>)
				<i>they ward off (provide shelter against</i>) the sea raised
			by the wind, <i><span class="en">
