				13.99
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυν σκεπάουσιν ἔθειραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					16.81
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιάουσι</span>
			).</div>
